WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.785
-Today is Friday, guys,
and that's usually

00:00:01.785 --> 00:00:03.903
when I catch up
on some personal stuff.

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:06.072
You know, I check my inbox.
I return some emails.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:07.707
And of course,
I send out thank you notes.

00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:09.842
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.842 --> 00:00:11.578
I was running
a bit behind today,

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:12.912
so I thought, if you guys
wouldn't mind, I'd like to

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:14.480
write out my weekly
thank you notes right now.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:15.715
Is that okay?

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:17.183
[ Applause ]

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:20.353
James, can I get some thank you
note writing music, please?

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:22.989
[ Gentle piano music playing ]
-Ahh.

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:26.559
He's in a good mood for once.
-Wow.

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:28.395
-That's the first time I've ever
seen him smile in my life.

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:30.763
-Yeah.

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:32.331
[ Piano music continues ]

00:00:32.331 --> 00:00:34.434
-"Thank you leaf blowers

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:37.270
for just making my leaves
someone else's problem."

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:38.304
[ Applause ]

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:40.640
"You deal with it."

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.707
-"Get out of the yard!"

00:00:41.707 --> 00:00:42.908
-I don't like the way it looks,

00:00:42.908 --> 00:00:46.312
so I'm gonna put it
on your property.

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:48.948
-Can you throw these away
for me?

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:50.883
-I do like
those Halloween garbage bags

00:00:50.883 --> 00:00:52.485
that were a hit
a couple of years ago.

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:54.186
-Oh, that you put the leaves in?
-Yeah.

00:00:54.186 --> 00:00:56.122
Some bags of garbage.

00:00:59.091 --> 00:01:00.593
Oh.

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:04.164
"Thank you to
Facebook going down,

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:05.765
for making it impossible to tell

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:07.900
my friend's sister's
college roommate's mother-in-law

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:09.536
that I liked her hat."

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:12.472
[ Applause ]

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:15.275
Cool hat.

00:01:17.409 --> 00:01:20.613
"Thank you, 'Squid Game' guards

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:21.881
for showing me
what it would look like

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:23.616
if a human
PlayStation controller

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:24.851
was trying to kill me."

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:27.053
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.456 --> 00:01:33.493
Wow.

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:35.361
-"Thank you

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:38.097
teaser trailer for
the new Adele song

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:39.498
for giving everyone a chance

00:01:39.498 --> 00:01:42.835
to schedule their emotional
health days ahead of time."

00:01:42.835 --> 00:01:44.804
It's gonna be good.
It's gonna be good.

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:46.772
I know. I could already feel it.

00:01:46.772 --> 00:01:48.741
I got the feels.
I got the feels, man.

00:01:52.344 --> 00:01:57.116
"Thank you, new Eggo
waffle-flavored Pop Tarts,

00:01:57.116 --> 00:01:58.851
and if toasted
breakfast-flavored

00:01:58.851 --> 00:02:01.820
toasted breakfast sounds good,

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:04.090
make sure you check out
beer-flavored Budweiser."

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:06.058
Tastes like beer.

00:02:06.058 --> 00:02:09.461
-Yeah!
-Yeah.

00:02:09.461 --> 00:02:11.397
-Coors-flavored Budweiser.

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:16.969
-"Thank you, scarecrows,
for always looking like

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:20.506
you're doing a spooky
'Titanic' reenactment."

00:02:20.506 --> 00:02:21.974
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.974 --> 00:02:23.743
-Two "Titanic" references.
-Two of them, man.

00:02:23.743 --> 00:02:25.678
-Hot topic. Everyone's
talking about "Titanic."

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:27.247
-Topical.

00:02:29.515 --> 00:02:31.617
-"Thank you, aftershave,

00:02:31.617 --> 00:02:34.153
for including the directions
right in your name."

00:02:34.153 --> 00:02:35.654
[ Applause ]

00:02:35.654 --> 00:02:38.558
-Wait, before?
-Before?

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:43.730
-"Thank you, baseball umpires,

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:45.965
for always looking like
you're mid-twerk."

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:46.999
There you have it, everybody.

00:02:46.999 --> 00:02:48.268
Those were my thank you notes!

